  "post_content": "<p>(8 fotos) L&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda est&agrave; duent a terme des de dilluns passat treballs d&#39;ampliaci&oacute; i millora de les instal&middot;lacions de la pista del Skate Park, situada al carrer de Segorbe, al final del carrer de Moncofa. Aquesta actuaci&oacute; t&eacute; un pressupost d&#39;uns 20.000 euros i &quot;respon a la petici&oacute; dels usuaris que van traslladar a l&#39;equip de govern la necessitat d&#39;introduir millores per a poder practicar en condicions m&eacute;s &ograve;ptimes els esports que all&iacute; es realitzen&quot;, segon indica una nota municipal.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reformaskatepark17/p1650310.jpg\" alt=\"p1650310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reformaskatepark17/p1650311.jpg\" alt=\"p1650311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reformaskatepark17/p1650314.jpg\" alt=\"p1650314\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reformaskatepark17/p1650315.jpg\" alt=\"p1650315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reformaskatepark17/p1650318.jpg\" alt=\"p1650318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reformaskatepark17/p1650319.jpg\" alt=\"p1650319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reformaskatepark17/p1650320.jpg\" alt=\"p1650320\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reformaskatepark17/p1650321.jpg\" alt=\"p1650321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
